## Compensation Analysis Presentation

## Overview

This folder contains the presentation materials for the Compensation Equity Analysis project.

## Purpose

The presentation summarises the business objectives, analytical approach, key findings, data quality considerations, 
and recommendations.

## Intended Audience

Recruiters, hiring managers, and business stakeholders interested in data analysis and compensation reporting.

## Files

A PDF version of the final presentation will be added here once it is ready.
